              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "effugiō, effugere — \"to escape\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Paucī ex incendiō effūgērunt. Few escaped from the fire."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "effugiō, effugere, effūgī: ex + fugiō, also with the accusative: perīculum effugere."
            }
          ]
        },
